WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.013
This is our home — and that fish keeps getting bigger.

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:11.029
Easy to infer: 133 trillion in revenue, more than double last year.

00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:16.042
Up 106 percent. Your fee goes up with it.

00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:19.128
Hold on… the floor is moving?

00:00:19.128 --> 00:00:21.443
My bill!

00:00:21.443 --> 00:00:25.044
Plenty of room! Deploy more agents!

00:00:25.044 --> 00:00:31.714
Its growth spurt is not our floor. Inference runs inside the tank.

00:00:31.714 --> 00:00:35.049
This tank is ours from now on.

00:00:35.049 --> 00:00:42.067
Sovereignty is in the tank, not in the fish. Sneeze again?

